# Video render outputs. The HyperFrames project source (index.html, the brief,
# hyperframes.json and the audio it references) is tracked, because without
# those the explainer cannot be rebuilt. Renders and QA snapshots are products
# OF that source -- 18MB and 1.5MB of it -- and regenerate on demand. The cut
# the site actually serves is committed separately at public/xmail-explainer.mp4.
video/*/renders/
video/*/snapshots/
